$C372 ; $A0: a rest, its duration next
$C385 ; a rest plays period 0
$C38F PatternEventCommand ; $80-$8F an instrument, $90-$BF an arpeggio, $C0-$FE a slide
$C397 ; the slide: the command byte, the delay, the step and the count
$C3C0 PatternEventArpeggio ; $BF: the slide off
$C3CA PatternEventSetArp ; the arpeggio record: 8 x the low nibble
